  "description": "A bike built around versatility and adventure. Equally at home as a big tire, adventure-gravel bike or as a do-it-all around town everyday bike. Or even for the daily commute on those pot holed roads, or off-road short cuts. Quick weekend dashes across the moors or load it up with racks and kit for multi-day adventures. The Cerium Gravel is a Swiss Army knife of a bike.\n\nFor the rider looking for an affordable, do-anything, dropped bar bike. For someone who wants just 1 bike that they can use for all the kinds of riding they have in mind. Gravel, commute, bike-packing and adventure. The Cerium Gravel can do it all.\n\nAs recommended by Cycling UK",
